---
// SecurityCompliance.astro - Trusted. Secure. Compliant.
---

<section class="security-section" id="security-compliance">
  <div class="security-inner">
    <div class="security-content">
      <div class="section-badge">Security &amp; Compliance</div>
      <h2 class="security-title">Trusted. Secure. Compliant.</h2>
      <ul class="security-list">
        <li>
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none"><circle cx="10" cy="10" r="10" fill="#FF4500" fill-opacity="0.1"/><path d="M6 10l3 3 5-5" stroke="#FF4500" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
          All data is encrypted in transit and at rest using industry-leading standards.
        </li>
        <li>
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none"><circle cx="10" cy="10" r="10" fill="#FF4500" fill-opacity="0.1"/><path d="M6 10l3 3 5-5" stroke="#FF4500" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
          Information is collected through a privacy-first approach with strict access permissions.
        </li>
        <li>
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none"><circle cx="10" cy="10" r="10" fill="#FF4500" fill-opacity="0.1"/><path d="M6 10l3 3 5-5" stroke="#FF4500" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
          End-to-end connectivity management
        </li>
        <li>
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none"><circle cx="10" cy="10" r="10" fill="#FF4500" fill-opacity="0.1"/><path d="M6 10l3 3 5-5" stroke="#FF4500" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
          Plans across 180+ countries
        </li>
        <li>
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none"><circle cx="10" cy="10" r="10" fill="#FF4500" fill-opacity="0.1"/><path d="M6 10l3 3 5-5" stroke="#FF4500" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
          Optimize telecom operations
        </li>
      </ul>
      <a href="#" class="btn btn-primary">Get Started</a>
    </div>

    <div class="security-badges">
      <div class="badge-row">
        <div class="compliance-badge">
          <img src="/images/sec-compliance/Cloud.png.webp" alt="Cloud" loading="lazy" />
          <span>Cloud</span>
        </div>
        <div class="compliance-badge">
          <img src="/images/sec-compliance/image-4.png.webp" alt="Stripe on Payments" loading="lazy" />
          <span>Stripe on Payments</span>
        </div>
        <div class="compliance-badge">
          <img src="/images/sec-compliance/image-5.png.webp" alt="Okta Uptime" loading="lazy" />
          <span>Okta Uptime</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="badge-row">
        <div class="compliance-badge">
          <img src="/images/sec-compliance/gdpr-1.png.webp" alt="GDPR" loading="lazy" />
          <span>GDPR</span>
        </div>
        <div class="compliance-badge">
          <img src="/images/sec-compliance/tax-1.png.webp" alt="Pre-Built Tax Integrations" loading="lazy" />
          <span>Pre-Built Tax Integrations</span>
        </div>
        <div class="compliance-badge">
          <img src="/images/sec-compliance/platform-1.png.webp" alt="Uptime" loading="lazy" />
          <span>Uptime</span>
        </div>
        <div class="compliance-badge">
          <img src="/images/sec-compliance/mongodb-1.png.webp" alt="MongoDB" loading="lazy" />
          <span>MongoDB</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .security-section {
    background: white;
    padding: 96px 2rem;
  }

  .security-inner {
    max-width: 1140px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 5rem;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .section-badge {
    display: inline-block;
    border: 1.5px solid #FF4500;
    color: #FF4500;
    border-radius: 999px;
    padding: 6px 20px;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .security-title {
    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 3vw, 2.5rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #1a1a2e;
    margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
  }

  .security-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0 0 2rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.875rem;
  }

  .security-list li {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    color: #444;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .security-list li svg {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin-top: 1px;
  }

  .btn {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 14px 32px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 1rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
  }

  .btn-primary {
    background: #FF4500;
    color: white;
  }

  .btn-primary:hover {
    background: #e03d00;
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(255, 69, 0, 0.3);
  }

  .security-badges {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }

  .badge-row {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .compliance-badge {
    background: #f9f9fb;
    border: 1px solid #eee;
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 0.875rem 1.25rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    min-width: 100px;
    flex: 1;
    transition: box-shadow 0.2s;
  }

  .compliance-badge:hover {
    box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.07);
  }

  .compliance-badge img {
    height: 36px;
    width: auto;
    max-width: 80px;
    object-fit: contain;
  }

  .compliance-badge span {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #666;
    text-align: center;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .security-inner {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 2.5rem;
    }
  }
</style>
